# Kristall shell module registry (docs/contracts/shell.md §2).
# One module name per line, loaded in this order from modules/<name>/Module.qml if that file exists.
# A module that is not there yet is skipped silently; one that fails to load is logged and skipped.
# Reserved names (owned by the agents that build them):
panels
dock
search
apps
switcher
assistant
setup
# New modules: add the directory and one line here.
